      "writtenOn": "2026-03-27T21:15:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can we keep this as an atomic since it makes the `IsSignaled()` check very cheap? If you keep it as an atomic, it will have to be outside the `State` (otherwise there\u0027s no point in making it atomic) in which case `State` should perhaps be renamed to `WaitLists` (or `WaitListState`)\n\nKeeping it separate also lets us refactor the code later to split the completion condition from the wait lists e.g. if we want multiple events to share the same wait lists with different completion conditions.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 65,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 65,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "24e47c296954a9e250fcdecf469c7113e3d16304",
