      "writtenOn": "2026-03-27T21:15:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This has a subtle issue - while you\u0027re iterating through the list, an event might become signaled. If that event has duplicate waits, you could mark some waits as not ready, before the event is signaled, and some waits as ready, after the event is signaled. We want all waits for a single event to return the same status.",
